      Part3: 790721166
      Part4: 1571819100
    tag: 
  allNodes:
  - dialogueText: Ok, so what's your deal?
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952739558129733
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 95.31743, y: 145.00003}
    altDialoguePaths:
    - rid: 3046479020823150693
    guid:
      Part1: 1371785725
      Part2: 1155082823
      Part3: 790721166
      Part4: 1571819100
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: Yes, yes, your deal, your story, why should I even bother talking
      to you?
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389322
    - rid: 6774952781063389323
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 716, y: 145.00002}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4061710421
      Part2: 1157530809
      Part3: 689992359
      Part4: 2139168062
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Really? Just like that? You''re going to give up on what might
      be a great story, just to be nice?

      Well, that''s disappointing. And
      here I was, thinking I could find a fellow soul as curious as myself...

      Oh,
      well, I guess it''s for the best, anyway. I wouldn''t want to share such a
      juicy scoop with anyone else.'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389324
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1585.7045, y: 503.00006}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1835412929
      Part2: 1133826685
      Part3: 4086251931
      Part4: 1568069625
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'I''m a <b>journalist</b>, mind you. I didn''t spend years of my
      life as the only woman in a prestigious journalism school just to be called
      a <b>reporter</b>.

      But now that you ARE getting curious, I''ll tell
      you: yes, I''m here as a journalist, getting into the least expected places
      to find the most <b>delicious</b> stories.

      No pun intended.'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389325
    - rid: 6774952781063389326
    - rid: 3046479020823150684
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2741.7046, y: 503.00006}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4197549194
      Part2: 1106058806
      Part3: 3232978570
      Part4: 3513204700
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Oh, sorry, my bad: I used to be a <b>food</b> critique, hence
      the <b>delicious</b> thing... Nevermind, it was bad anyways.

      Luckily
      for the staff here, I''m not anymore! My fingers would cram if I had to put
      into words the absolute trainwreck that was today''s lunch.

      That borshch
      was truly abhorrent... Who hired this Chef?'
    characterEmotion: 5
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389335
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4076, y: 664}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3941858783
      Part2: 1303965904
      Part3: 1164245432
      Part4: 1086083098
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well, a little, very trustworthy and fact-checked bird told me
      that they saw an important figure drive all the way this place.

      Which,
      by itself, should be suspicious, but it gets even MORE interesting when you
      realize that he was not <b>alone</b> in this car.

      My "bird" did not
      recognize this second man, but it would seem that this is more than just a
      simple vacation.'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389336
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4104, y: 431.99997}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3083354042
      Part2: 1306995897
      Part3: 2998380477
      Part4: 334009166
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "And what better for that than a cozy hotel! \nWe all know that
      that business always take place in isolated, but seemingly innocuous places.\nTake
      the <b>sauna</b> upstairs, for instance... if it wasn't for the fact that the
      door won't budge, that would be perfect for negotiating.\nThey should have
      hung up the right sign, though.. my nose still hurts from trying to open it..."
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479020823150669
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5341, y: 431.99997}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2103101816
      Part2: 1171027430
      Part3: 1203153824
      Part4: 517255940
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '<b>DON''T LOOK AT IT!</b>

      I mean... yes, you''re right,
      but that doesn''t give you the right to just<b>take</b> it and examine it without
      permission.

      Not all the pictures there are for journalistic purposes,
      anyway...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479020823150687
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4135.7593, y: 864.9999}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3904504250
      Part2: 1156721203
      Part3: 4217359239
      Part4: 3240803103
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Oh... Crap, I guess you''re right.

      Ok, you got me: while
      I DID arrive too late to take pictures of my main target, I, um... decided
      to take the opportunity to photograph the... next best thing here.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479020823150689
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5370.773, y: 864.9999}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2658239048
      Part2: 1075406793
      Part3: 2025165492
      Part4: 4256412502
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'You''re kidding, right? Didn''t you see him, sitting there? That''s
      Aleksei... like, <b>THE</b> Aleksei, the one of the sculptures and such?

      I
      must say, I''d seen pictures of him before... but I guess cameras can''t always
      do a person justice, the way his sculptures can.

      I''ve heard rumours
      from my co-workers about him being... a bit deranged, but, wow... I never wanted
      a source to be so wrong before...'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479020823150691
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 6667.431, y: 864.9999}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1303805693
      Part2: 1269938290
      Part3: 977965754
      Part4: 4203366471
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "All right, Mr. Mistery... We have some stuff in common, you and
      I... just try to not get in my way, alright?\nI'm in the midst of getting my
      biggest scoop yet! \nSomething so outstanding that'll surely make anyone who
      ever doubted me regret their actions."
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389334
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1604.0001, y: -75.65594}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1128017573
      Part2: 1252307847
      Part3: 2114866107
      Part4: 1501563185
